        "original_id": "b30bb4a5-7b72-586f-81c5-f140c8dc5246",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Travis Mays, Raymond Downs, Thurman \"Slue\" Hull, Marshall Hughes\n- Organizations: Texas Longhorns men's basketball, University of Texas at Austin, Big 12 Conference, NCAA Division I\n- Places: Ocala, Florida, Oklahoma City, Ford Center\n- Schools: Vanguard High School\n- Events: 2009 Phillips 66 Big 12 Men's Basketball Championship\n\nFacts:\n- Raymond Downs was a three-year starter for the Texas Longhorns men's basketball team under head coach Thurman \"Slue\" Hull in 1955–56.\n- Raymond Downs was a three-year starter for the Texas Longhorns men's basketball team under head coach Marshall Hughes in 1957.\n- The 2009 Phillips 66 Big 12 Men's Basketball Championship was the 13th edition of the Big 12 Conference's championship tournament.\n- The 2009 Phillips 66 Big 12 Men's Basketball Championship was held at the Ford Center in Oklahoma City from March 11 to March 14, 2009.\n- Travis Mays was born in Ocala, Florida.\n- Travis Mays played basketball for Vanguard High School before enrolling at the University of Texas to compete for the Longhorns.\n- The Texas Longhorns men's basketball team represents the University of Texas at Austin in NCAA Division I intercollegiate men's basketball competition.\n- The Texas Longhorns men's basketball team currently competes in the Big 12 Conference.",
